		"description": "Complete test collection for Slice 1 of the ESP APM Agent Service.\nValidates: Health Check, Simple Glossary Queries, Two-Turn CLARIFY -> BIND Roundtrips, Alias Resolution, Asset Priority (Explicit > UI), Pronoun Resolution, META Turns, and Empty Message Guard.\n\nAll tests parse chunked NDJSON response frames.",
